The front-goal solver is a ReScript port of the Rust front-goal search of wstein/cubacle
(src/engines/three/partial/ and src/engines/three/cubie.rs, ABI 3 export crates/wasm/src/front.rs),
revision 8b4aafea3fd2719af84d1e3548009eff5e7733b5 on branch feat/wasm-front-goal-export (unpushed when recorded), based on develop at
0216da533c39bd64cfe96a2f10210ec04be668b1. The ported files and their SHA-256 are in provenance.json.
